Build and package standalone GUI for macOS.

Create a macOS .app bundle with proper Info.plist, icon, and code signing.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] CMake builds on macOS (Homebrew SDL2)
- [ ] .app bundle created with proper structure
- [ ] Info.plist with correct bundle ID and version
- [ ] Application icon included
- [ ] Runs on macOS 12+ (Apple Silicon and Intel)

## Test Plan
- [ ] Build on macOS, verify .app bundle created
- [ ] Double-click .app, verify launches correctly
- [ ] Test on both Apple Silicon and Intel (if available)
